Tip 1

---------------------------------
Design with your video clips
---------------------------------

Did you know you can upload your own videos to Canva? It=E2=80=99s simple, =
no matter what device you=E2=80=99re on. And there are a number of ways you=
 can do it.

1  Select the Uploads tab in the side panel of the Canva editor, click =E2=
=80=98Upload an image or video,=E2=80=99 then choose a file from your devic=
e.
2  Drag and drop a video file from your computer into the editor. You=E2=80=
=99ll see it automatically added to your Uploads.
3  If you=E2=80=99re using the Canva mobile app, simply choose a template, =
select the image/video, then scroll through your camera roll and upload vid=
eos directly to Canva.
